  "description": "AsiBackbone 4.0.0 starts the stable 4.x line with claim leasing enabled by default for governance outbox safety, bounded reclaim and dead-letter behavior, hardened endpoint metadata and correlation handling, canonical capability-grant payload construction, explicit signature failure categories, and corrected EF Core store binding and terminal-state persistence. Package IDs, public namespaces, and the net10.0 target remain unchanged; AssemblyVersion advances to 4.0.0.0.",
